<%# locals: (stamp:) %>
<%# The latest live signal of the inbox above the organisations: an opaque stamp
    (Notifications::InboxQuery.stamp), drawn with the page and replaced by
    Notifications::UnreadSignals on Notifications::Streams.all_inboxes. Nothing
    else travels on that stream. all_inboxes_live_controller compares it with
    the stamp the list was drawn with (_drawn_stamp). %>
<div id="<%= Notifications::UnreadSignals::ALL_INBOXES_SIGNAL_ID %>" hidden
     data-all-inboxes-live-target="signal" data-stamp="<%= stamp %>"></div>
